      "writtenOn": "2026-09-03T14:13:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re right, I missed the ApplyComplete response side. Per\nDSP0267 v1.3.0 §12.9 the response can send\nComponentActivationMethodsModification back. My read of the word\n\"modification\" is that it REPLACES the package\u0027s ReqCompActivationMethod\nfor that specific component — the device is telling us what it\nactually needs.\n\nPatchset 3: track effective methods per (device, component), starting\nfrom the package value and overwriting with the ApplyComplete\nresponse where present.",
      "parentUuid": "6cb823a5_bd982532",
      "revId": "ac31eb4e8a8e513d06d50a7c158733cb37e5ea40",
