      "writtenOn": "2026-08-25T10:17:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This doesn\u0027t take into account that multiple bits can be set at the same time. If both the bits for ACPowerCycle and SelfContained are set for all the devices, we would default to ACPowerCycle",
      "revId": "ac31eb4e8a8e513d06d50a7c158733cb37e5ea40",
