      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is dead code.\n\n`bool requiresOperatorAction(const std::bitset\u003c16\u003e\u0026 agg)` returns everything except `actMethodSelfContained` so this part of the condition will never be reached.",
      "revId": "ac31eb4e8a8e513d06d50a7c158733cb37e5ea40",
